WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Your books. Your handwriting. Write with the pen.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:13.800
Pen writes. Finger selects. Keep native text highlights and dictionary lookup.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:21.200
Eight colors. Inline pen and marker options. Color-preserving exports.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:27.600
A round launcher. Drag anywhere; tap to open and close with ×.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:36.000
Dictionary Audio: English and synthetic Spanish pronunciation. Example: libro.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.400
English and Spanish switches. Normal, Slower, or Very slow Spanish.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.400
PageScribe and Dictionary Audio. Independent plugins, integrated controls.

